<header class="doi-docs__intro">
    <h1>DOI Confirm Bundle</h1>
    <p class="doi-docs__lead">Safe email confirmation, contact-field updates and practical consent evidence for forms completed by the contacts themselves.</p>
    <div class="doi-docs__callout">A DOI click demonstrates access to the mailbox. It does not prove the person's civil identity. Preserve both the form submission and the confirmation event.</div>
</header>

